<h2 id=3D"6">New release 1.1.0 of ifs-fractals</h2>
<div class=3D"outline-text-2" id=3D"text-6">
<p>
Archive: <a href=3D"https://discuss.ocaml.org/t/new-release-1-1-0-of-ifs-fr=
actals/18425/1">https://discuss.ocaml.org/t/new-release-1-1-0-of-ifs-fracta=
