<p>
After using GOD for a while, I realized it=E2=80=99s actually better suited=
 for phonetic scripts rather than ideograph. Because of that, I designed a =
new library specifically for ideograph (especially Chinese): <b>Smaji Glyph=
 Stroke Description (GSD)</b>.
</p>

<p>
For a deeper dive into GOD, the differences between it and GSD, and the pro=
s/cons of each use case, check out the links at the beginning. I'll keep it=
 brief here=E2=80=94feel free to check those out if you're interested!
</p>
